From 0d343e37b085a516f8f6e16a9e51f420f18d4664 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:03:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] test-posix: Check <search.h>, hsearch, the tree
 functions and the queues

Add test-search_h (types, posix_tnode, prototypes, namespace),
test-hsearch (one table, strcmp lookups, hdestroy freeing its entries,
ENOMEM) and test-tsearch (node contents, tdelete's return values, twalk's
order and levels, out of memory), and extend the insque, remque, lfind
and lsearch tests to circular lists, odd widths and other comparisons.
